            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The issue is the Git itself, as it shows characters that it thinks are \"unusual\" in a hexadecimal form. This results into file being named as `\"czy\\305\\274yk.md\"` when computing data about the hunk patch.\n\nThis can/will be solved in 'mini.diff' itself with extra flag when computing data about the hunk patch, but in the meantime you can follow [this advice](https://stackoverflow.com/a/22828826) and do `git config core.quotepath off`.",
